{
  "_about": "Documented defaults for nougen_verse. Every threshold, weight and cutoff used by the engine lives here. Override with a JSON file (env NOUGEN_VERSE_CONFIG), with env vars shaped NOUGEN_VERSE__SECTION__KEY=value (value parsed as JSON when possible), or with the overrides argument of load_config(). See docs/config.md.",
